    "spec": {
      "approved_by": "SamuelJennings",
      "at": "2026-08-19T10:05:00Z",
      "self_resolved": [
        "Title fallback chain ends at the citation key so the linked cell is never an empty-value marker",
        "Contributor names in a table cell stay linked to their contributor pages",
        "Credited names capped at three with a translatable indication that more exist",
        "Five columns sort; credited names and the edit control declare themselves unsortable",
        "Item type sorts by the stored CSL value, not the translated label, and the documentation says so",
        "Search and filter controls switched off by name rather than left to an upstream default",
        "The card list is not deprecated; a project restores it with a one-line routing change",
        "Presentation only: no model, no field, no migration",
        "The governance clause forbidding amendment alongside feature work becomes a disclosure rule, so the amendment Sam directed is not self-contradicting"
      ]
